# React Admin Rules for SmartTravel

## Guidelines
- **Framework**: React 19, TypeScript (strict mode), Vite
- **Architecture**: `src/features/`, `src/components/`, `src/core/`, `src/types/`
- **Type Safety**: Strict TypeScript. No `any` types. TypeScript interfaces MUST match backend DTO definitions.
- **API Client**: Service modules in `src/core/api.ts` or `src/features/<feature>/api.ts`.
- **UI & Components**: Functional components with clear prop types. Follow modular design.

## Verification
- Always run `cd admin && npm run build` (runs `tsc -b` and Vite build) after modifying admin code.

